10
00:47:43,636 --> 00:47:49,636
Luck is a 2022 American animated fantasy comedy film directed by Peggy Holmes from a screenplay written by Kiel Murray, and a story conceived by Murray and
the writing team of Jonathan Aibel and Glenn Berger, based on an original concept created by Rebeca Carrasco, Juan De Dios, and Julián Romero.

11
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Produced by Skydance Animation, the film features the voices of Eva Noblezada, Simon Pegg, Jane Fonda,
Whoopi Goldberg, Flula Borg, Lil Rel Howery, Colin O'Donoghue, and John Ratzenberger.

12
00:57:16,363 --> 00:57:22,363
Set in the Land of Luck, the story follows the unluckiest person, Sam Greenfield (Noblezada), as
she must unite with a talking black cat named Bob (Pegg) to turn her luck around.

13
01:02:02,727 --> 01:02:08,727
The project was announced in July 2017, shortly after Skydance Animation was formed on March
16, 2017, with Paramount Pictures distributing as the schedule for March 2021.

14
01:06:49,090 --> 01:06:55,090
Alessandro Carloni signed on to direct the film
from a script by Aibel and Berger.

15
01:11:35,454 --> 01:11:41,454
The film underwent many changes during production, such as rewrites, directors, and release dates,
and Holmes was later announced as the new director in January 2020, replacing Carloni.

16
01:16:21,818 --> 01:16:27,818
Much of the main voice cast, including Noblezada and Pegg, signed on in January 2022,
following the casting of Fonda and Goldberg in February and June 2021, respectively.

17
01:21:08,181 --> 01:21:14,181
Production was done remotely during the COVID-19 pandemic.

18
01:25:54,545 --> 01:26:00,545
Luck premiered in Madrid on August 2, 2022, and was released on Apple TV+
and in select theaters in the United States on August 5.

19
01:30:40,909 --> 01:30:46,909
The film received mixed reviews from critics.

20
01:35:27,272 --> 01:35:33,272
The film explores themes of superstition, bad luck,
leprechaun, computer animation, female protagonist.

21
01:40:13,636 --> 01:40:19,636
The tone is lighthearted.
